# External library suppressions for ThreadSanitizer (P0-28 audited minimal set)
# 1. Qt6 QTest Watchdog thread internal stack variable race during QTest::qExec teardown
race:libQt6Test
# 2. Qt6 QTest Watchdog QThread leak at process exit (Desk32 uses std::thread exclusively and never calls QThread::start)
thread:QThread::start
# 3. PipeWire pw_thread_loop internal mutex unlock across loop/control threads
mutex:libpipewire-0.3.so
